[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14167.15, "timestamp": "03:56:07", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14189.11, "timestamp": "03:56:29", "text": "我们可以问问 cla 之类的吗？克劳德"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14195.83, "timestamp": "03:56:35", "text": "或者其他什么东西，所以我们不需要这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14198.469, "timestamp": "03:56:38", "text": "其中一部分。如果评分结果为“否”，则表示该回复是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14202.51, "timestamp": "03:56:42", "text": "等于项目数。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14206.79, "timestamp": "03:56:46", "text": "呃，我可以向人工智能寻求帮助吗？可以吗？好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14211.91, "timestamp": "03:56:51", "text": "我打算从事人工智能方面的工作。我不能，我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14213.79, "timestamp": "03:56:53", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14217.07, "timestamp": "03:56:57", "text": "我相信云"}]